89
00:09:13.636 --> 00:09:14.804
Si Mrs. To ay isa ring chaebol.

90
00:09:14.887 --> 00:09:16.764
Iba siya.

91
00:09:16.847 --> 00:09:17.974
Nilikha niya ang kanyang sarili.

92
