Mukhang mahusay.

292
00:26:28.211 --> 00:26:29.337
kain na tayo

293
00:26:29.421 --> 00:26:32.257
Ang restaurant na ito ay dapat na mahusay.

294
00:26:32.340 --> 00:26:34.217
Pagkatapos kumain nang tahimik hangga't maaari.

295
00:26:34.301 --> 00:26:35.468
- Ito ay katumbas ng halaga.
- Tara kain na tayo.

296
00:26:36.052 --> 00:26:36.886
salamat po.

297
00:26:38.054 --> 00:26:38.930
Napakasarap.

298
00:26:40.223 --> 00:26:41.766
- Hayaan mong ibuhos kita.
- Pakiusap.

299
00:26:43.685 --> 00:26:45.937
- Mag-toast tayo, Mrs. To.
- Oo naman.

300
00:26:46.021 --> 00:26:49.274
Itaas natin ang ating salamin sa kagandahan, sigasig,
kabutihan at kagalakan!

301
00:26:49.357 --> 00:26:50.567
Para kay CEDAR!

302
00:26:53.945 --> 00:26:54.988
Para kay CEDAR!

303
00:26:55.989 --> 00:26:57.615
- Para sa CEDAR!
- Para sa CEDAR!

304
00:26:57.699 --> 00:26:58.616
CEDAR...

305
